	quest.0E0EA762472F2E63.quest_desc: [
		"Hidden &7&lfar above the clouds&r in &f&lthe Aether&r lies the &fBronze Dungeon,&r a quiet, &3echoing tomb&r untouched by time."
		""
		"At its heart dwells &f&lthe Slider,&r a mechanical sentinel of forgotten ages. It speaks no words, makes no sound, yet its presence weighs heavily in the air."
		""
		"Only those who brave the silence and emerge victorious will earn the &lEye of Silence.&r"
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &ffind/kill the boss.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&f🌀 &lLocation:&r Found at the end of Bronze Dungeons in the Aether."
		""
		"&f🌀 &lWeakness:&r Vulnerable only to pickaxes  "
		""
		"&f🌀 &lStrengths:&r Strong knockback, resistant to normal attacks"
		""
		"&6🌀 &lDifficulty: Medium"
		""
		"(Search &f\"&f&lBronze Dungeon&r&f\"&r in the compass.)"
	]
