	quest.1AA32D13CA1BB784.quest_desc: [
		"&bIn the &ldeepest snowbound crypts,&r&r&r where the cold never dies and time forgets its name, the &b&lNight Lich waits.&r&r"
		""
		"Once a sorcerer of the stars, it fell to frost and fury, consumed by the silence between the &drealms.&r &b&lThe Eye of Winter&r now rests in its grasp, pulsing with the last breath of a &bfrozen age.&r"
		""
		"Slay the &b&lNight Lich&r and claim the Eye."
