	quest.39E004BEB4E00B10.quest_desc: [
		"&5&lBeyond the void,&r past realms touched by &6sunfire,&r &8shadow,&r &bfrost&r and &5arcana…&r lies the heart of all endings."
		""
		"In the ruined firmament of &5the End,&r the &5&lEnder Dragon&r circles the &5&lCelestial Anchor&r — the shattered cradle of the &d&lStar Gate.&r"
		""
		"&3&lThe 12 Eyes have awakened the path,&r and destiny spirals to a close. But this is no mere dragon. It is &dbound to the cosmos&r, empowered by every Eye, and sealed behind ancient rites."
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &5find/kill the boss.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&d🜄 &lLocation:&r The End, accessed via the reassembled Star Gate."
		""
		"&d🜄 &lBoss:&r takes less damage until the End Crystals are destroyed."
		""
		"&4🜄 &lDifficulty: Very High&r"
		""
