	quest.4215107FB9956862.quest_desc: [
		"The fall of the &5&lCorrupted One&r brought peace to the End, but not all wounds heal so easily."
		""
		"For ages, the void twisted those who wandered too close to its power. Endermen, once simple travelers between worlds, became warped by lingering corruption, their forms stretched and broken beyond recognition."
		""
		"These creatures, known as the &5&lMutant Enderman,&r are among the last scars left upon the End."
		""
		"They are not evil. They are victims of a war that ended long ago."
		""
		"To face them is not an act of conquest, but of mercy."
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &8find/kill the boss.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&5👁 &lLocation:&r The End."
		""
		"&5👁 &lSpawn:&r Mutant Endermen can be summoned using an &5Chemical X&r on an Enderman."
		""
		"&5👁 &lBeware:&r Its immense strength, long reach, and teleportation make it a dangerous foe."
		""
		"&6👁 &lDifficulty: Medium&r"
		""
		"Bring strong armor and keep your distance when possible."
		""
		"The End may be at peace, but its echoes remain."
	]
