	quest.4CE1FD3B6E13AF8D.quest_desc: [
		"In the &6scorched belly of the Nether,&r something ancient stirs, &4not born, but forged.&r"
		""
		"&6&lThe Nether Gauntlet&r is a sentinel of stone and flame, bound to defend the &6&lEye of Ember&r until the end of days. It knows no words, only weight, fury, and the &6&lfire of a dying world.&r"
		""
		"To claim the Eye, &4&lyou must break the unbreakable.&r"
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &6find/kill the boss.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6🔥 &lLocation:&r Underground fortress in the Nether"
		""
		"&6🔥 &lAttacks:&r Laser Beam, Blindness, and devastating slams  "
		""
		"&6🔥 &lBring Ranged Tools,&r a strong shield, and while this is not a battle of speed, but endurance."
		""
