	quest.4E4B585C78A19E42.quest_desc: [
		"&3&lLong ago,&r the &l&1Star Gate&r shattered. &3Its twelve Eyes,&r now scattered across the realms, are guarded by beings of great power and mystery."
		""
		"To reforge the Gate and face the &l&5Corrupted One,&r you must retrieve each Eye, one from every guardian below."
		""
		"Your journey begins now, &l&3Starborne&r."
		""
		"⬦ &b&lEye of Winter&r – &bNight Licht&r  "
		""
		"⬦ &8&lEye of Ruin&r – &8Invoker&r  "
		""
		"⬦ &c&lEye of the Grove&r – &cDeer God&r "
		""
		"⬦ &2&lEye of Dusk&r – &2Void Blossom&r  "
		""
		"⬦ &6&lEye of Ember&r – &6Nether Gauntlet&r "
		""
		"⬦ &8&lEye of Binding&r – &8Blackstone Golem&r   "
		""
		"⬦ &7&lEye of Decay&r – &7Wither&r  "
		""
		"⬦ &lEye of Silence – Slider  "
		""
		"⬦ &e&lEye of Echoes&r – &eValkyrie Queen&r  "
		""
		"⬦ &4&lEye of the Sun&r – &4Sun Spirit&r   "
		""
		"⬦ &3&lEye of the Abyss&r – &3Stalker  "
		""
		"⬦ &5&lEye of Arcana&r – &5Magus&r "
		""
		"Collect all twelve to open the path to the &l&5End&r and restore the &l&1Star Gate.&r"
	]
