	quest.4F2A36F719F591E3.quest_desc: [
		"Deep within &c&luntamed woodlands,&r where roots whisper and winds remember, dwells &l&cthe Deer God,&r a creature of &3myth, &5magic,&r and &cmourning.&r"
		""
		"It once guided &2balance and life,&r but time and silence have twisted its path. Now it wanders &csacred groves&r in restless rage, guarding &c&lthe Eye of the Grove,&r the key to rebirth and decay alike."
		""
		"Tread lightly, &3&lStarborne.&r The forest sees more than you do."
