	quest.56052440ADA9DAA9.quest_desc: [
		"Above the clouds, in the golden chambers of the Aether, the &4&lSun Spirit&r slumbers in &4fire and flame.&r"
		""
		"Its chamber is sealed, lit only by &6eternal sunlight,&r and guarded by trials of worth. Awaken it, and you’ll face a being of pure &4radiant fury.&r"
		""
		"Only the bold can claim the &4&lEye of the Sun,&r a shard of brilliance that once illuminated the &3&lStar gate.&r"
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &4find/kill the boss.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&4🔥 &lLocation:&r in the Gold Dungeon in the Aether.  "
		""
		"&4🔥 &lCannot:&r be damaged until dialogue ends."
		""
		"&4🔥 &lRains:&r down fire, summons blaze-like spirits."
		""
		"&4🔥 &lDifficulty: Medium&r"
		""
		"You can use the &l&7Explorer's Compass&r to help."
		""
		"(Search &4\"&4&lGold Dungeon&r&4\"&r in the compass.)"
	]
