	quest.59B0A245CACC1924.quest_desc: [
		"High within the floating palaces of the Aether, &6&la timeless presence watches over the skies.&r"
		""
		"&e&lThe Valkyrie Queen,&r both judge and warden, guards the &e&lEye of Echoes,&r a relic that resonates with voices long past. &6Only those deemed worthy may challenge her,&r and even fewer return with the &6prize.&r"
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &efind/kill the boss.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&e⚔ &lLocation&r at the end of a Silver Dungeon in the Aether "
		""
		"&e⚔ &lChallenge&r must be accepted by right-clicking her with 10 &aVictory Medals&r"
		""
		"&e⚔ &lAttacks&r Bring Ranged Tools, Flying attacks, and Normal Ground Attack."
		""
		"&6⚔ &lDifficulty: Medium"
		""
		"You can use the &l&7Explorer's Compass&r to help."
		""
		"(Search &e\"&e&lSilver Dungeon&r&e\"&r in the compass.)"
	]
	quest.59B0A245CACC1924.quest_subtitle: "Among halls of &elight and wind,&r the Queen waits in silence."
	quest.59B0A245CACC1924.title: "&e&lWings of the Forgotten"
	quest.59B5BFBFABF1F620.quest_desc: [
		"Though the &3&lStar Gate&r has been restored and the &5Corrupted One&r defeated, not every relic of the ancient age has found peace."
		""
		"Deep within the End rests the &5&lObsidilith,&r a colossal construct forged by the &6Celestial&r long before the world's fall. It was never meant to conquer—it was created to endure."
		""
		"With its purpose long forgotten, the monolith attacks any who dare approach, unable to distinguish friend from foe."
		""
		"Perhaps granting it rest is the final kindness Everwild can offer."
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &8find/kill the boss.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&5🪨 &lLocation:&r Found naturally throughout the Outer End Islands."
		""
		"&5🪨 &lMechanic:&r Uses devastating shockwaves and launches massive obsidian pillars."
		""
		"&5🪨 &lBeware:&r Its attacks can destroy terrain and quickly overwhelm unprepared adventurers."
		""
		"&4🪨 &lDifficulty: Hard&r"
		""
		"You may use the &l&7Explorer's Compass&r to help."
		""
		"(Search &8\"&8&lObsidilith&r&8\"&r in the compass.)"
	]
	quest.59B5BFBFABF1F620.quest_subtitle: "A relic of the Celestial still endures."
