	quest.5A13FA3A0CA0D42E.quest_subtitle: "In older versions of the mod (minecraft v1.12) machines used to blow up and cables would break if you used a power tier too high for them. This is no longer the case although you will still see the transformers in rei, they are not needed.\\n\\n TLDR Transformers are only useful for restricting energy flow."
