	quest.5C51B2DB890AFE3B.quest_desc: [
		"Not all darkness sleeps in the End. &5&lSome of it blooms.&r"
		""
		"&2&lThe Void Blossom&r is a being of &dpetal&r and &apoison,&r a guardian of the in-between that thrives in &5corrupted biomes.&r Its roots dig into both reality and shadow, &3drawing power from what was lost when the stars fell.&r"
		""
		"To claim the &2&lEye of Dusk,&r you must &4tear it from the heart of this silent predator.&r"
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &2find/kill the boss.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&2🪷 &lLocation:&r In the deepest depths of this world...  "
		""
		"&2🪷 &lAttacks:&r Venomous bombs, Abyssal Spikes, and Void Blossom Shields.  "
		""
		"&2🪷 &lBeware&r of lingering damage and warped terrain during battle."
		""
		"&2🪷 &lDifficulty: Easy"
		""
		"Craft a &2&lVoid Lily&r and follow its path... "
		"(or use the &7&lExplorers Compass&r but thats boring. 😊)"
	]
