	quest.6C1ECDAF1E3FCB54.quest_desc: [
		"One piece was cast beyond the world, where it drifted through the void until a new realm formed around its immense power. Over countless ages, this forgotten land became known only as the &d&lRealmwalker.&r"
		""
		"Its ancient guardian protects the final fragment of the Gate, ensuring no soul can restore what was broken."
		""
		"Beyond the veil lies the &d&l&lEye of Arcana,&r the last key needed to rebuild the &3Star Gate.&r"
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &dfind/kill the boss.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&5🟣 &lLocation:&r The Realmwalker dimension."
		""
		"&5🟣 &lSummon:&r Right-click the Mask you got from the last quest to challenge the Realmwalker."
		""
		"&4🟣 &l&4Difficulty: Very Hard&r"
		""
		"Only by defeating the Realmwalker can the final Eye be reclaimed."
		""
		"The &l&7Explorer's Compass&r cannot guide you beyond the Veil."
	]
	quest.6C1ECDAF1E3FCB54.quest_subtitle: "When the &3&lStar Gate&r shattered, not every fragment fell upon Everwild."
	quest.6C1ECDAF1E3FCB54.title: "&5&lBeyond the Veil"
