	quest.6F7B4C455E2D2694.quest_desc: [
		"In the broken chapels of the &l&8Illager Inquisition,&r a figure rises above the rest, twisted by &5dark devotion and empowered by forbidden rites.&r"
		""
		"&8&lThe Invoker&r is no mere Illager. It is a &5&lcorrupted prophet&r who hears echoes from &3beyond the stars.&r Through its ruinous power, it clutches the Eye of Ruin."
		""
		"&6&lYour task is clear:&r strike down the heretic and reclaim what was stolen from the light."
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &8find/kill the boss.&r"
