	quest.79403A462F0A81BD.quest_desc: [
		"&l&3Long ago,&r the world of &2&lEverwild&r was ignited by the &3&lCelestial,&r a radiant being born of the stars. But when &4the stars faded and the sky grew silent,&r the &3Celestial vanished. The Star Gate was shattered,&r its fragments scattered across the realms and sealed within the &2Eyes of Eternity,&r powerful artifacts needed to restore the gate and journey to the End, where the Corrupted One awaits."
		""
		"&3&lYou are the Starborne,&r a being touched by the &6remnants of that ancient light,&r destined to reforge what was broken."
		""
		"&4&lYour journey spans across 14 quests:&r"
		""
		"• &3&l1 Introduction&r"
		""
		"• &2&l12 Eyes of Eternity&r"
		""
		"• &5&l1 Final Battle with the Corrupted One)&r"
	]
