	quest.794DF5B358C3463F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain the &3&lWarden's Tools&r."
	quest.794DF5B358C3463F.title: "&3&lWarden's Tools"
	quest.795A9F4CCA040309.quest_desc: ["Create &l&4Netherite&r-&l&fIron Tools&r by simply putting a &l&4Netherite Tool&r, &l&4Netherite&r-&l&fIron Ingot&r, and a &8Smithing Template&r all in a Smithing Table."]
	quest.795A9F4CCA040309.quest_subtitle: "Create &4Netherite&r-&fIron Tools&r."
	quest.795A9F4CCA040309.title: "&l&4Netherite&r-&l&fIron Tools"
	quest.798A2936F8F101CE.quest_subtitle: "Aluminum is a component in a lot of things around you. However the most readily available should be clay and bauxite.\\n\\n To get aluminum it's recommended to electrolyze &dClay dust&r / &dBauxite dust&r or industrially grind &dBauxite ore&r"
	quest.7995B43E2AD0FB3B.quest_subtitle: "&3Harbinger of Death..."
	quest.7995B43E2AD0FB3B.title: "&4&lHarbinger"
	quest.79CEEF8BCC389131.quest_subtitle: "Use a book in a spell table to unlock the power of &6&lEarth."
	quest.79CEEF8BCC389131.title: "&6&lMountain peak Journal"
	quest.7A237B031A88435B.title: "&a&lThalassian Sickle"
	quest.7A2DC11143F76935.quest_desc: ["Slowly restores the player's hunger bar when walking on grass. Can be found in jungle temples, pillager outposts, strongholds and ancient cities. Can be found through archaeology in trail ruins."]
	quest.7A2DC11143F76935.quest_subtitle: "I AM GROOT."
	quest.7A65EF0C27CD0BA1.title: "&2&lRanger Leggings"
	quest.7A7FF3F096F008DE.quest_desc: ["Create &l&4Netherite&r-&b&lDiamond Boots&r by simply putting &l&4Netherite&r-&2&lEmerald Boots&r, &l&4Netherite&r-&b&lDiamond Ingot&r, and a &8Smithing Template&r all in a Smithing Table."]
	quest.7A7FF3F096F008DE.quest_subtitle: "Create &4Netherite&r-&bDiamond Boots&r."
	quest.7A7FF3F096F008DE.title: "&l&4Netherite&r-&b&lDiamond Boots"
	quest.7A92E997071D6F0C.title: "&bHornets Needle"
	quest.7ADC3916197FD452.quest_subtitle: "By centrifuging 8 marble dust you can get yourself a small amount of magnesium dust."
	quest.7AE342DE0869F0DB.quest_subtitle: "Useful stuff you can forge from Dragon Scales."
	quest.7AE342DE0869F0DB.title: "&8&lDragon Loot Extra"
	quest.7B38A0326D02AC5D.title: "&4Fallen God's Sword"
	quest.7B4C2C344D8B3903.title: "&cFloral Sabre"
	quest.7B86674432D514BF.quest_subtitle: "If you're running low on resources, now might be the time to get an assembling machine as it allows for some alternate crafts for circuits that cut down on costs. \\n\\nOne specific recipe that might of interest is the &dElytra&r but how are you going to get those End Rods?"
	quest.7BCA3069494D846D.quest_subtitle: "By using Mercury instead of water in your industrial grinder you can significantly increase its yield. \\n\\nObtained by centrifuging either redstone dust or cinnabar dust"
	quest.7BDCD1F9619F9CC6.quest_subtitle: "Navigates you to whatever &8structure&r you want."
	quest.7BDCD1F9619F9CC6.title: "&8&lExplorer's Compass"
	quest.7C13DFA133DE1331.quest_desc: [
		"Though the &3Star Gate&r has been restored, balance is not the same as peace."
		""
		"From the emptiness beyond creation rises the &4&lMonarch of Chaos,&r an ancient sovereign who sought to unravel the world long before the Corrupted One ever drew breath."
		""
		"It did not serve the corruption."
		""
		"It simply welcomed it."
		""
		"Now, with the barriers between realms weakened by countless battles, the Monarch stirs once more, determined to return Everwild to endless disorder."
		""
		"Its defeat will not restore the world..."
		""
		"But it will ensure that its future belongs to those who forged it."
		""
		"Use the &2next page&r to find information on how to &4find/kill the boss.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&4👑 &lLocation:&r Summoned through the Soulslike Weaponry progression."
		""
		"&4👑 &lPreparation:&r Gather the relics required to challenge the Monarch."
		""
		"&4👑 &lBeware:&r Chaos magic, devastating melee attacks, and overwhelming power await those who enter its domain."
		""
		"&4👑 &lDifficulty: Extreme&r"
		""
		"Only the greatest champions of Everwild can hope to bring an end to Chaos itself."
	]
	quest.7C13DFA133DE1331.quest_subtitle: "Where order ends, chaos reigns."
	quest.7C13DFA133DE1331.title: "&4&lMonarch of Chaos"
	quest.7C20055475FCD3E8.quest_subtitle: "Using two iron furnaces and some refined iron you are able to fashion a primitive alloy smelter allowing for some new materials to be created."
	quest.7C49F0FACCD4F6C9.title: "&6&lTerra Robe Bottom"
	quest.7C57243B4430CD1B.quest_subtitle: "Make &l&6Cincinnasite tools&r like any other tool but instead of Sticks you Nether Reed."
	quest.7C57243B4430CD1B.title: "&l&6Cincinnasite Tools"
	quest.7C5E521BE75EABA9.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to open your &5Ender Chest&r anywhere."
	quest.7C5E521BE75EABA9.title: "&l&5Ender Pouch"
	quest.7D0CDCF0CEAB84FB.quest_desc: ["Increases the player's swimming speed by 100%. Can be found in buried treasure chests, shipwrecks and large underwater ruins. Very rarely worn by naturally spawned drowned."]
	quest.7D0CDCF0CEAB84FB.quest_subtitle: "flap. flap. flap."
	quest.7E08E1AD1C996212.quest_subtitle: "Kill a &8Wither Skeleton&r and obtain its head. "
	quest.7E08E1AD1C996212.title: "&8&lWither Skull"
	quest.7E1CC2DD6CE7913E.quest_subtitle: "Found in the &4&lNether City&r."
	quest.7E1CC2DD6CE7913E.title: "&l&4Fire Ruby Template"
	quest.7E1E28C112FA47BA.quest_desc: ["Make a &2cartographer villager&r using a cartography table to get a Trial Chamber map and go to it."]
	quest.7E1E28C112FA47BA.quest_subtitle: "Fight like your life depends on it..."
	quest.7E1E28C112FA47BA.title: "Find The Trial Chambers"
	quest.7E4B219E3817CAAB.title: "&4Bloody Death"
	quest.7E4E5B131F2A9BC7.title: "&8&lBattle Quiver"
	quest.7E62549D44F2120E.title: "&l&bTundra Hood"
	quest.7F5F866953D11A71.quest_desc: ["Reduces the time it takes to drink drinkable items by 70%, and reduces the time it takes to eat items by 40%. Can be found in abandoned mineshafts, buried treasure chests and nether fortresses. Very rarely worn by naturally spawned skeletons. Can be found through archaeology in desert wells."]
	quest.7F5F866953D11A71.quest_subtitle: "And just like that i'm drunk."
